{
  "_doc": "ui-spec page id -> v4 route. honest_page = the whole page is a declared 'Not simulated in Vyomi' gap (requires a consoles/honest-allowlist.json entry; apigateway has none yet, so no page here sets it — AgentCore targets / Developer portals are built as honest in-page NotSimulatedContainer sections instead, with the gap's note naming every spec'd column/action so they score as declared gaps, not missing). 'fixtures' pre-creates a fixed-name prerequisite resource (idempotent, like s3's 'uic-bucket'); 'vars' maps a spec {placeholder} to that fixed name; 'live' separately proves liveness ('no statics') with a uniquely-named resource created just before the page loads.",
  "welcome": {
    "route": "#/apigateway"
  },
